        <mxCell id="mW3YPvvujHNH-cWorNNl-1" parent="1" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;" value="数据源有三种&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;JetBrains Mono&amp;quot;, monospace; font-size: 9.8pt; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);&quot;&gt;Event、&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;JetBrains Mono&amp;quot;, monospace; font-size: 9.8pt; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);&quot;&gt;Property、&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;JetBrains Mono&amp;quot;, monospace; font-size: 9.8pt; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);&quot;&gt;Service&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;，将这三种类封装，继承接口&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;JetBrains Mono&amp;quot;, monospace; font-size: 9.8pt; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);&quot;&gt;ModelData&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;。&lt;br&gt;因为是根据type属性进行分类的，所以&lt;/span&gt;接口定义公共字段type.&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;JetBrains Mono&amp;quot;, monospace; font-size: 9.8pt; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); color: rgb(0, 51, 179);&quot;&gt;sealed interface &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;JetBrains Mono&amp;quot;, monospace; font-size: 9.8pt; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);&quot;&gt;ModelData &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;JetBrains Mono&amp;quot;, monospace; font-size: 9.8pt; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); color: rgb(8, 8, 8);&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)&quot;&gt;{&lt;/font&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#080808&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;JetBrains Mono&amp;quot;, monospace; font-size: 9.8pt; background-color: light-dark(rgb(255, 255, 255), rgb(18, 18, 18)); color: rgb(0, 51, 179);&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;val &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;JetBrains Mono&amp;quot;, monospace; font-size: 9.8pt; background-color: light-dark(rgb(255, 255, 255), rgb(18, 18, 18)); color: rgb(135, 16, 148);&quot;&gt;type&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;JetBrains Mono&amp;quot;, monospace; font-size: 9.8pt; background-color: light-dark(rgb(255, 255, 255), rgb(18, 18, 18)); color: light-dark(rgb(8, 8, 8), rgb(230, 230, 230));&quot;&gt;: &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: &amp;quot;JetBrains Mono&amp;quot;, monospace; font-size: 9.8pt; background-color: light-dark(rgb(255, 255, 255), rgb(18, 18, 18));&quot;&gt;String&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;JetBrains Mono&amp;quot;, monospace; font-size: 9.8pt; background-color: light-dark(rgb(255, 255, 255), rgb(18, 18, 18)); color: light-dark(rgb(8, 8, 8), rgb(230, 230, 230));&quot;&gt;?&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;JetBrains Mono&amp;quot;, monospace; font-size: 9.8pt; background-color: light-dark(rgb(255, 255, 255), rgb(18, 18, 18)); color: light-dark(rgb(8, 8, 8), rgb(230, 230, 230));&quot;&gt;},在&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 98, 122); font-family: &amp;quot;JetBrains Mono&amp;quot;, monospace; font-size: 9.8pt; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);&quot;&gt;getItemViewType&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: light-dark(rgb(255, 255, 255), rgb(18, 18, 18)); color: light-dark(rgb(8, 8, 8), rgb(230, 230, 230)); font-family: &amp;quot;JetBrains Mono&amp;quot;, monospace; font-size: 9.8pt;&quot;&gt;中需要提前将type转换成枚举的属性&lt;/span&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="110" width="330" x="350" y="260" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="mW3YPvvujHNH-cWorNNl-2" parent="1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;rounded=0;" value="适配器和fragment层中各自对数据源进行处理，适配器中没有数据流向，只是框架。分类的标准在getItemViewType当中" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="55" width="340" x="710" y="270" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="mW3YPvvujHNH-cWorNNl-3" parent="1" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;" value="在&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;JetBrains Mono&amp;quot;, monospace; font-size: 9.8pt; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);&quot;&gt;ViewHolder&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;中UI数据绑定，因为方法参数类型是接口，只有一个属性，但子实现类有不同的结构，需要统一结构的数据中转类&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;JetBrains Mono&amp;quot;, monospace; font-size: 9.8pt; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); color: rgb(0, 51, 179);&quot;&gt;fun &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;JetBrains Mono&amp;quot;, monospace; font-size: 9.8pt; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); color: rgb(0, 98, 122);&quot;&gt;bind&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;JetBrains Mono&amp;quot;, monospace; font-size: 9.8pt; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); color: rgb(8, 8, 8);&quot;&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;JetBrains Mono&amp;quot;, monospace; font-size: 9.8pt; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);&quot;&gt;item&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;JetBrains Mono&amp;quot;, monospace; font-size: 9.8pt; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); color: rgb(8, 8, 8);&quot;&gt;: &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;JetBrains Mono&amp;quot;, monospace; font-size: 9.8pt; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);&quot;&gt;ModelData&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;JetBrains Mono&amp;quot;, monospace; font-size: 9.8pt; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); color: rgb(8, 8, 8);&quot;&gt;){&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;JetBrains Mono&amp;quot;, monospace; font-size: 9.8pt; background-color: light-dark(rgb(255, 255, 255), rgb(18, 18, 18)); color: rgb(0, 51, 179);&quot;&gt;val &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;JetBrains Mono&amp;quot;, monospace; font-size: 9.8pt; background-color: light-dark(rgb(255, 255, 255), rgb(18, 18, 18)); color: light-dark(rgb(8, 8, 8), rgb(230, 230, 230));&quot;&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;JetBrains Mono&amp;quot;, monospace; font-size: 9.8pt; background-color: light-dark(rgb(255, 255, 255), rgb(18, 18, 18)); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;name&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;JetBrains Mono&amp;quot;, monospace; font-size: 9.8pt; background-color: light-dark(rgb(255, 255, 255), rgb(18, 18, 18)); color: light-dark(rgb(8, 8, 8), rgb(230, 230, 230));&quot;&gt;, &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;JetBrains Mono&amp;quot;, monospace; font-size: 9.8pt; background-color: light-dark(rgb(255, 255, 255), rgb(18, 18, 18)); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;key&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;JetBrains Mono&amp;quot;, monospace; font-size: 9.8pt; background-color: light-dark(rgb(255, 255, 255), rgb(18, 18, 18)); color: light-dark(rgb(8, 8, 8), rgb(230, 230, 230));&quot;&gt;, &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;JetBrains Mono&amp;quot;, monospace; font-size: 9.8pt; background-color: light-dark(rgb(255, 255, 255), rgb(18, 18, 18)); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;typeText&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;JetBrains Mono&amp;quot;, monospace; font-size: 9.8pt; background-color: light-dark(rgb(255, 255, 255), rgb(18, 18, 18)); color: light-dark(rgb(8, 8, 8), rgb(230, 230, 230));&quot;&gt;, &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;JetBrains Mono&amp;quot;, monospace; font-size: 9.8pt; background-color: light-dark(rgb(255, 255, 255), rgb(18, 18, 18)); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;rwText&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;JetBrains Mono&amp;quot;, monospace; font-size: 9.8pt; background-color: light-dark(rgb(255, 255, 255), rgb(18, 18, 18)); color: light-dark(rgb(8, 8, 8), rgb(230, 230, 230));&quot;&gt;, &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span st